	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.anathema-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "A Malefic Scrin support power effect which gradually increases damage output and speed over 30 seconds, but unit is destroyed once the effect ends. Bonus firepower scales inversely with the value of the affected unit.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.anathema-Name": "Anathema",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.anathema-Strengths": "• Gains firepower, rate of fire and speed gradually over 30 seconds",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.anathema-Weaknesses": "• Destroyed once effect ends",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.defensematrix-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Granted by GDI Zone Defenders to nearby allied infantry, increasing their effective health.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.defensematrix-Name": "Defense Matrix",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.defensematrix-Strengths": "• Increased effective health by 1250 per stack (up to 6 stacks)",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.frenzy-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Granted by the eponymous Marked of Kane support power. Increases rate of fire and movement speed, but reduces them once the effect ends.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.frenzy-Name": "Frenzy",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.frenzy-Strengths": "+33% rate of fire\\n+25% movement speed",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.frenzy-Weaknesses": "-15% rate of fire after effect ends\\n-15% movement speed after effect ends",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.gyro-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "An effect granted by activating the Gyro Stabilizers ability available via upgrade to Talon mechs which increases weapon range but reduces rate of fire.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.gyro-Name": "Gyro Stabilizers",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.gyro-Strengths": "+33% weapon range",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.gyro-Weaknesses": "-25% rate of fire",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.hotu-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Granted by the Heroes of the Union support power available to the Soviets after adopting the Infantry Doctrine. Increases effective health, speed, rate of fire and range.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.hotu-Name": "Hero of the Union",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.hotu-Strengths": "Effective health boosted to 28k\\n+20% movement speed\\n+50% range\\n+50% rate of fire",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.hypercharge-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "An effect granted by activating the Hypercharge ability available via upgrade to Scrin Seekers and Lacerators. Allows the unit to fire continuously for a short duration while taking increased damage. After the effect ends the unit has reduced speed, damage and rate of fire for a short time.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.hypercharge-Name": "Hypercharge",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.hypercharge-Strengths": "• Continuous fire",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.hypercharge-Weaknesses": "+20% increased damage taken",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.inspiration-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Applied to basic infantry within range of a Soviet Commissar, Troop Crawler or Overlord Tank. Increases movement speed and rate of fire.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.inspiration-Name": "Inspiration I",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.inspiration-Strengths": "+30% movement speed\\n+10% rate of fire",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.inspiration2-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Applied to basic infantry within range of two or more different units that apply the Inspiration effect. Further increases movement speed and rate of fire.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.inspiration2-Name": "Inspiration II",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.inspiration2-Strengths": "+40% movement speed\\n+20% rate of fire",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.ionsurge-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Effect granted by a Traveler-59 support power which increases movement speed.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.ionsurge-Name": "Ion Surge",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.ionsurge-Strengths": "+50% movement speed",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.ironcurtain-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Soviet minor superweapon effect which grants temporary invulnerability.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.ironcurtain-Name": "Iron Curtain",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.ironcurtain-Strengths": "• Immune to all damage",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.ironcurtain-Weaknesses": "• Speed capped to Heavy Tank speed",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.naniterepair-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Applied by an ARC support power. Repairs vehicles over time.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.naniterepair-Name": "Nanite Repair",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.naniterepair-Strengths": "• Repairs 5% health per second",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.naniteshield-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Granted by the support power available with the third level of GDI's Hold the Line Strategy. Absorbs a portion of incoming damage.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.naniteshield-Name": "Nanite Shield",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.naniteshield-Strengths": "• Absorbs 50% of incoming damage",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.tibstealth-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Applied by the minor superweapon power granted by Nod's Stealth Generator. Makes units invisible to enemies until it attacks or is attacked, and reduces damage taken.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.tibstealth-Name": "Tiberium Stealth",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.buffs.tibstealth-Strengths": "• Invisible to enemies\\n-10% damage taken",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.atomized-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "An effect that can only be applied Collector-73's Atomizer unit. Deals damage over time and reduces movement speed and firepower.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.atomized-Name": "Atomized",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.atomized-Weaknesses": "• Deals periodic damage\\n-33% movement speed\\n-33% damage dealt",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.berserk-Attributes": "+25% movement speed\\n+100% rate of fire",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.berserk-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Applied via Yuri's Chaos Gas, or the Rage Generator ability of Nod Idols of Kane. Causes affected units to uncontrollably attack nearby units.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.berserk-Name": "Berserk",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.berserk-Weaknesses": "• Attacks units indiscriminately",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.blinded-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Disables unit vision and weapons.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.blinded-Name": "Blinded",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.blinded-Weaknesses": "• Vision disabled\\n• Weapons disabled",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.chill-Attributes": "• Stacks up to 10 times",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.chill-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Applied by Allied cryo weaponry. Reduces movement speed and makes affected units take more damage.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.chill-Name": "Chilled",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.chill-Weaknesses": "-25/35/43/50/56/59/62/65/68/70% movement speed\\n+10% damage received per stack",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.concussion-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Reduces rate of fire and movement speed.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.concussion-Name": "Concussed",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.concussion-Weaknesses": "-25% movement speed\\n-50% rate of fire",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.emp-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Completely incapacitates vehicles, heavy cyborgs and defenses. Causes unshielded aircraft to crash.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.emp-Name": "EMP",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.emp-Weaknesses": "• Movement disabled\\n• Weapons disabled\\n• Abilities disabled\\n• Unshielded aircraft crash to ground",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.irradiated-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Applied by Iraqi Desolators and Eradicators. Causes periodic AoE damage, reduces outgoing damage and increases incoming damage.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.irradiated-Name": "Irradiated",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.irradiated-Weaknesses": "• Deals periodic damage to nearby units\\n• Irradiates the ground\\n-10% damage dealt\\n+10% damage received",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.jammed-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Applied by Allied Radar Jammers. Reduces vehicle weapon damage and rate of fire.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.jammed-Name": "Jammed",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.jammed-Weaknesses": "-10% damage dealt\\n-20% rate of fire",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.reapersnared-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Applied by Nod Cyborg Reapers' snare ability. Completely incapacitates infantry.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.reapersnared-Name": "Reaper Snared",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.reapersnared-Weaknesses": "• Movement disabled\\n• Weapons disabled\\n• Abilities disabled",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.suppression-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "An effect applied by the Scrin Suppression power, Masterminds and Enervators. Reduces movement speed and rate of fire.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.suppression-Name": "Suppressed",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.suppression-Weaknesses": "-60% movement speed\\n-20% rate of fire",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.targetpainted-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Increases damage received and reveals the unit to enemies.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.targetpainted-Name": "Target Painted",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.targetpainted-Weaknesses": "Revealed to enemies\\n+10% damage received",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.veiled-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Applied by Allied Gap Generators, Black Eagles, Tiger Guards, and England's Veil of War support power. Reduces weapon and vision range.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.veiled-Name": "Veiled",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.veiled-Weaknesses": "-20% weapon range\\n-20% vision range",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.warped-EncyclopediaExtrasDescription": "Applied by Allied Chrono Prisons and Germany's Time Warp ability. Completely incapacitates the target, but makes it immune to non-warping damage.",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.warped-Name": "Warped",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.warped-Strengths": "• Immune to non-warping damage",
	"Actor-encyclopedia.debuffs.warped-Weaknesses": "• Movement disabled\\n• Weapons disabled\\n• Abilities disabled",
