	"Actor-zeal.covenant-Attributes": "(!) Only ONE Covenant may be chosen.",
	"Actor-zeal.covenant-Description": "Adopt the Covenant of Zeal.\\n\\n• Level 1: Confessor Cabal & Fast Harrassers (+15% Bike/Buggy/Howitzer speed)\\n• Level 2: Cyborg Armor & Raider Buggy Upgrades\\n• Level 3: Enlightened, Cyborg Elite & Cyborg Speed Upgrade",
